sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant UI as Attendance page
  participant API as Express API
  participant OWN as ownership check
  participant AS as AttendanceService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  S->>UI: choose date, click Absent
  UI->>API: POST /courses/:id/attendance (Bearer JWT)
  API->>API: verify JWT, validate body
  API->>OWN: ownedCourse(courseId, studentId)
  OWN->>DB: SELECT course WHERE id AND student_id
  alt not found or not owner
    OWN-->>UI: 404 Course not found
  else owner
    API->>DB: INSERT attendance_records
    API->>DB: COUNT present / absent for course
    DB-->>API: attended, conducted
    API->>AS: summarise(attended, conducted, minPercent, maxAbsences)
    AS-->>API: percentage, status, formula, working
    API-->>UI: 201 record + summary
    UI->>S: show percentage, warning badge and working
  end
